  "details": "I used a free VPN for a year, at that time I had no questions about the connection.\nLoaded worlds and avatars only through VPN. The free period ended yesterday..\nI thought everything would work if you wait, but this did not happen.\nI will briefly describe the problem! When launched, when a username and password are entered, it does not require a connection to a third-party network, after logging in, it does not download anything.\nHe throws out the sign “We`re sorry! Something went wrong!”; at this time the avatars of people are not loaded, they turn red. Avatars of worlds and contacts in a friend list, the same thing in the tab with the worlds - the inscription \"content not loaded\" appears.\nDownload something from the servers or vice versa via VPN, all these problems will disappear. If something is loaded, it will be loaded from the cache, but without a vpn you can only sit on pre-loaded content. But the cache still has to be cleaned, since I have so little free space on my C drive.",
